---
import ManagerLayout from '../../layouts/ManagerLayout.astro';
import ManagerAccess from '../../components/ManagerAccess.astro';
---
<ManagerLayout title="Товары" active="products"><section data-workspace="products"><header class="dash-header"><div><p class="dash-eyebrow">Каталог и наполнение</p><h1>Товары</h1></div><div class="dash-header-actions"><a href="/manager/products/edit" class="dash-button dash-primary">+ Добавить товар</a><button type="button" class="dash-button" data-workspace-refresh>Обновить</button></div></header><ManagerAccess/><div data-workspace-content hidden><section class="dash-panel" data-product-drafts-panel hidden><div class="dash-section-head"><h2>Черновики в работе</h2></div><p class="dash-help">Не опубликованы. Начальные остатки будут учтены при публикации.</p><div data-product-drafts class="dash-quality-list"></div></section><div class="mgr-filter-panel"><label class="dash-field">Показать<select data-product-scope><option value="active">Активные товары</option><option value="archived">Удалённые</option></select></label><label class="dash-field mgr-search">Найти товар<input data-product-search type="search" placeholder="Название товара"/></label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input data-product-incomplete type="checkbox"/>Только незаполненные</label><label class="dash-checkbox"><input data-product-demo type="checkbox"/>Демонстрационные</label></div><section class="dash-panel"><div class="dash-section-head"><h2>Каталог</h2><span data-product-count></span></div><p class="dash-help">Добавляйте и редактируйте обычные товары в одной форме. Для комплектов и сложных справочников доступна CMS.</p><div class="dash-quality-list" data-product-list></div><p class="dash-empty" data-product-empty hidden>Товары не найдены.</p><nav class="mgr-pagination" data-product-pagination aria-label="Страницы товаров"></nav></section></div></section><script>import '../../scripts/manager-products';</script></ManagerLayout>
